            <ArticleTitle>Clinical electrophysiology of ventricular tachycardia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>253-73</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Programmed ventricular stimulation, electrophysiologic effects of various antiarrhythmic drugs, and the results of serial electrophysiologic testing in patients with ventricular arrhythmias are discussed. The use of discriminant analysis to predict the efficacy of antiarrhythmic drugs is also briefly analyzed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
